login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-16T09:22:04Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T09:25:57Z","body":"> The part that modifies the `EditorInspector` overlaps with #115533.\r\n\r\nThe PR referenced doesn't fix this problem (I checked it). The code actually doesn't overlap, your PR doesn't modify lines 630 - 635.\r\n\r\nThe modifed part in my code:\r\n\r\n``` cpp\r\n// Line 630, from master (so no changes by any of the (not)conflicting PR-s)\r\nint v_ofs = (size.height - font->get_height(font_size)) / 2;\r\nif (rtl) {\r\n\tdraw_string(font, Point2(size.width - ofs - text_limit, v_ofs + font->get_ascent(font_size)), label, HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_RIGHT, text_limit, font_size, color);\r\n} else {\r\n\tdraw_string(font, Point2(ofs, v_ofs + font->get_ascent(font_size)), label, HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_LEFT, text_limit, font_size, color);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou can implement this fix in your code, then I will remove it from this. The fix is to add a `text_limit > 0` check before drawing the text:\r\n\r\n``` cpp\r\nif (text_limit > 0) {\r\n\tint v_ofs = (size.height - font->get_height(font_size)) / 2;\r\n\tif (rtl) {\r\n\t\tdraw_string(font, Point2(size.width - ofs - text_limit, v_ofs + font->get_ascent(font_size)), label, HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_RIGHT, text_limit, font_size, color);\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\tdraw_string(font, Point2(ofs, v_ofs + font->get_ascent(font_size)), label, HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_LEFT, text_limit, font_size, color);\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4466445464/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4467098601","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119497#issuecomment-4467098601","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119497","id":4467098601,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCkKD6Q","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-16T14:15:09Z","updated_at":"2